{"id":"vod_sn_99093","vodId":"99093","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"机械手臂","name_cn":"机械手臂","date":"2024-01-01","year":"2024","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20241004-1/a34c742fad3106b670443b4e93ccf037.jpg"},"summary":"大约 100 年前。为了寻求在母星中枯竭的生命能量”阿比特“的机械生命体从异次元来访。它们为了穿梭次元，将姿态收缩到手臂模样，降落在”阿比特“丰富的地球上，通过寄生在其他生物上而得以在地球上生活，并与一部分人类秘密接触，开始寻找”阿比特“。人们将那个模样的它们称为“机械臂”。\r\n　　时间来到现代。某个封印着“机械臂”的立方体从大企业“镜集团”的研究设施中遗失了。偶然发现那个的普通中学生·光解开了立方体的封印。从那里出现的是沉眠了 100 年的“机械臂”阿尔玛。阿尔玛想要寄生在光的身上……光和阿尔玛的奇妙共同生活就这样意外开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-12-20 01:23:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v11.rstu6.com/202410/04/SJfwAyG2143/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v1.rstu6.com/202410/11/JpTUVzRrsS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v4.rstu6.com/202410/18/ce4KHir6h24/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v2.rstu6.com/202410/25/zvUh9zSWjF22/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v2.rstu6.com/202411/01/LMBJ1xmpP820/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v2.rstu6.com/202411/08/sfK2cbEsGQ24/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v4.rstu6.com/202411/15/1KHxmHu03523/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v5.rstu6.com/202411/22/jqRrKbA0Gq24/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v2.rstu6.com/202411/29/BFXgH3c5xe22/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202412/06/DL1Rn3TyVC20/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202412/13/ePxSr4HUrF21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v4.rstu6.com/202412/20/Czw7EWkfGd23/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:43.006Z"}